/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   Floating header tools (operator request 2026-06-11, follow-on to the
   header clean pass)
   --------------------------------------------------------------------
   The 44px topbar row held only the QAT + bell/settings/account after
   the Ask pill was removed. Convert it to a compact floating pill
   pinned to the page's top-right corner: the row leaves the layout
   flow, so every view's content — including the command icon strip —
   rises ~44px. Popovers (notifications, account) already anchor
   fixed top-right, so they open under the pill unchanged.
   ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.topbar{
  position:fixed;top:8px;right:16px;left:auto;width:auto;height:36px;
  padding:0 6px;gap:4px;z-index:60;border-radius:9999px;
  /* soft glass pill so the cluster reads deliberately when content
     scrolls beneath it */
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.78);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px) saturate(1.4);
  backdrop-filter:blur(10px) saturate(1.4);
  border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,.08);
  box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(15,23,42,.06);
}
.topbar .rr-qat{margin-right:0}

/* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   Strip to the top + sidebar tool dock (operator request 2026-06-11,
   follow-on to #2785)
   --------------------------------------------------------------------
   1. Every view's top padding collapses to 6px so the command icon
      strip (and plain page headers) sit at the top of the page.
   2. The floating tool cluster moves OFF the canvas entirely: bell /
      settings / account become a compact vertical dock pinned to the
      bottom of the sidebar rail (above the theme/collapse foot) —
      no view content can ever collide with it, in either rail state.
   3. The QAT is hidden in the dock: its riders stay reachable (Undo
      lives on the schedule strip; Refresh app is in the account menu).
   4. The notification/account popovers re-anchor beside the dock
      (their inline top:50px was tuned to the old topbar).
   ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.view > .page{padding-top:6px!important}
/* schedule-rrx.css:49 pins `#view-schedule.rrx-schedule > .page{padding:
   var(--rr-space-200)!important}` — match its specificity to win the top
   edge (other sides keep their gutter). Onboarding-ops shares the TCP
